<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>

<!--
	The simulation of a project (haumacher/ehome #58, #62, de.haumacher.ehome.simulation): the runtime image of
	the project (its rules, schedules and datapoints) run against a virtual installation of its devices on the
	loopback address, on a simulated clock that moves by "Step" (to the next timer, schedule firing or
	midnight), "Fast-forward" (by the duration entered) and, after "Real time", "10 times" or "60 times" until
	"Pause", by itself at that multiple of real time. At most one simulation runs per project, shared by
	everybody looking at the project; it is stopped when the application shuts down. The virtual installation
	is a KNXnet/IP gateway (the status names it), which the group monitor reaches like a real one. With a time
	master in the project's settings, the simulation broadcasts the simulated time on its addresses as the
	controller does (TimeMaster).

	"project" is the project. "state" is the state of the simulation (simulationState, SimulationFunctions),
	recomputed from "refresh", which every command writes and, while the view is displayed, every change of
	the simulation (<simulation-updates>, SimulationUpdatesElement: a telegram arriving, the clock moving, a
	rule acting, at most every 500 ms). The rows of the tables stand for their rule, parameter, datapoint or
	entry, so a selection survives the updates.

	- Rules: per rule the diagnostics of the engine - enabled, state, firings, last trigger and last action
	with their simulated times, errors and the last error, the remaining time of its timers and the values
	of its parameters (* an override).
	- Parameters: every parameter of every rule (the enable switch included) with its value, default and
	whether it is an override; "Set" and "Reset" change the selected one as a controller's UI does. The
	overrides are stored with the rules of the project (simulationValue, simulationEnabled) and are the values
	the next simulation starts with.
	- Datapoints: the datapoints of the image with value, quality, time of the last update and binding.
	"Send" lets a device of the installation send the value to the datapoint's group address (the device whose
	object sends there, else an input device of the installation); "Command" commands the datapoint as a
	controller's UI does.
	- Timeline: what happened, newest first: telegrams received and sent, commands of the rules, logs of the
	rules and the scheduler, parameter changes, the clock and the problems.
	- Device behaviour: the object followers of the project (ehome.runtime:ObjectFollower): which object of a
	device takes the values another object of the device receives (a channel's state following its switching
	object), inverted for an object of one bit. The program data of a device does not say this, so the user
	names the pairs; they take effect when a simulation starts.
-->
<view>
	<channels>
		<channel name="project"/>
		<channel name="refresh"/>
		<channel name="startTime"/>
		<channel name="duration"/>
		<channel name="selectedParameter"/>
		<channel name="parameterValue"/>
		<channel name="selectedDatapoint"/>
		<channel name="datapointValue"/>
		<channel name="follower"/>
		<derived-channel name="state"
			expr="p -> r -> simulationState($p, $r)"
			inputs="project, refresh"
		/>
		<derived-channel name="status"
			expr="s -> $s['status']"
			inputs="state"
		/>
		<derived-channel name="next"
			expr="s -> $s['next']"
			inputs="state"
		/>
		<derived-channel name="clock"
			expr="s -> $s['clock']"
			inputs="state"
		/>
	</channels>
	<simulation-updates
		project="project"
		refresh="refresh"
	>
		<split-panel
			orientation="vertical"
			resizable="true"
		>
			<panes>
				<pane
					min-size="160"
					size="25"
					unit="%"
				>
					<panel>
						<title>
							<en>Simulation</en>
							<de>Simulation</de>
						</title>
						<commands>
							<generic-command
								image="css:bi bi-play-circle"
								input="state"
								placement="TOOLBAR"
							>
								<label>
									<en>Start</en>
									<de>Starten</de>
								</label>
								<executability>
									<model-access
										object="project"
										operation="Write"
									/>
									<disabled-if expr="s -> simulationStartVeto($s['project'], $s)"/>
								</executability>
								<execute-script function="t -> s -> simulationStart($s['project'], $t)">
									<inputs>
										<input channel="startTime"/>
									</inputs>
								</execute-script>
								<write-channel name="refresh"/>
							</generic-command>
							<generic-command
								image="css:bi bi-play"
								input="state"
								placement="TOOLBAR"
							>
								<label>
									<en>Real time</en>
									<de>Echtzeit</de>
								</label>
								<executability>
									<model-access
										object="project"
										operation="Write"
									/>
									<disabled-if expr="s -> simulationSpeedVeto($s['project'], 1, $s)"/>
								</executability>
								<execute-script function="s -> simulationRun($s['project'], 1)"/>
								<write-channel name="refresh"/>
							</generic-command>
							<generic-command
								image="css:bi bi-speedometer"
								input="state"
								placement="TOOLBAR"
							>
								<label>
									<en>10 times real time</en>
									<de>10-fache Echtzeit</de>
								</label>
								<executability>
									<model-access
										object="project"
										operation="Write"
									/>
									<disabled-if expr="s -> simulationSpeedVeto($s['project'], 10, $s)"/>
								</executability>
								<execute-script function="s -> simulationRun($s['project'], 10)"/>
								<write-channel name="refresh"/>
							</generic-command>
							<generic-command
								image="css:bi bi-speedometer2"
								input="state"
								placement="TOOLBAR"
							>
								<label>
									<en>60 times real time</en>
									<de>60-fache Echtzeit</de>
								</label>
								<executability>
									<model-access
										object="project"
										operation="Write"
									/>
									<disabled-if expr="s -> simulationSpeedVeto($s['project'], 60, $s)"/>
								</executability>
								<execute-script function="s -> simulationRun($s['project'], 60)"/>
								<write-channel name="refresh"/>
							</generic-command>
							<generic-command
								image="css:bi bi-pause-circle"
								input="state"
								placement="TOOLBAR"
							>
								<label>
									<en>Pause</en>
									<de>Pause</de>
								</label>
								<executability>
									<model-access
										object="project"
										operation="Write"
									/>
									<disabled-if expr="s -> simulationPauseVeto($s['project'], $s)"/>
								</executability>
								<execute-script function="s -> simulationPause($s['project'])"/>
								<write-channel name="refresh"/>
							</generic-command>
							<generic-command
								image="css:bi bi-skip-end"
								input="state"
								placement="TOOLBAR"
							>
								<label>
									<en>Step</en>
									<de>Schritt</de>
								</label>
								<executability>
									<model-access
										object="project"
										operation="Write"
									/>
									<disabled-if expr="s -> simulationRunVeto($s['project'], $s)"/>
								</executability>
								<execute-script function="s -> simulationStep($s['project'])"/>
								<write-channel name="refresh"/>
							</generic-command>
							<generic-command
								image="css:bi bi-fast-forward"
								input="state"
								placement="TOOLBAR"
							>
								<label>
									<en>Fast-forward</en>
									<de>Vorspulen</de>
								</label>
								<executability>
									<model-access
										object="project"
										operation="Write"
									/>
									<disabled-if expr="s -> simulationRunVeto($s['project'], $s)"/>
								</executability>
								<execute-script function="d -> s -> simulationAdvance($s['project'], if($d == null, '30min', $d))">
									<inputs>
										<input channel="duration"/>
									</inputs>
								</execute-script>
								<write-channel name="refresh"/>
							</generic-command>
							<generic-command
								image="css:bi bi-stop-circle"
								input="state"
								placement="TOOLBAR"
							>
								<label>
									<en>Stop</en>
									<de>Anhalten</de>
								</label>
								<executability>
									<model-access
										object="project"
										operation="Write"
									/>
									<disabled-if expr="s -> simulationRunVeto($s['project'], $s)"/>
								</executability>
								<execute-script function="s -> simulationStop($s['project'])"/>
								<write-channel name="refresh"/>
							</generic-command>
							<generic-command
								image="css:bi bi-arrow-clockwise"
								input="state"
								placement="TOOLBAR"
							>
								<label>
									<en>Refresh</en>
									<de>Aktualisieren</de>
								</label>
								<execute-script function="s -> simulationState($s['project'])"/>
								<write-channel name="refresh"/>
							</generic-command>
						</commands>
						<inset>
							<stack gap="compact">
								<text input="status"/>
								<text
									input="next"
									tone="secondary"
								/>
								<text
									input="clock"
									tone="secondary"
								/>
								<fields>
									<value-input
										type="tl.core:DateTime"
										value="startTime"
									>
										<label>
											<en>Start of the simulated clock</en>
											<de>Beginn der simulierten Uhr</de>
										</label>
										<placeholder>
											<en>Now</en>
											<de>Jetzt</de>
										</placeholder>
									</value-input>
									<value-input
										type="tl.core:String"
										value="duration"
									>
										<label>
											<en>Fast-forward by</en>
											<de>Vorspulen um</de>
										</label>
										<placeholder>
											<en>30min</en>
											<de>30min</de>
										</placeholder>
									</value-input>
								</fields>
							</stack>
						</inset>
					</panel>
				</pane>
				<pane
					min-size="200"
					size="75"
					unit="%"
				>
					<tab-bar active-tab="rules">
						<tabs>
							<tab id="rules"
								icon="css:bi bi-diagram-3"
							>
								<label>
									<en>Rules</en>
									<de>Regeln</de>
								</label>
								<table filter-bar="true">
									<inputs>
										<input channel="state"/>
									</inputs>
									<columns>
										<computed-column name="id"
											type="tl.core:String"
											width="160"
										>
											<label>
												<en>Rule</en>
												<de>Regel</de>
											</label>
											<value>r -> $r['id']</value>
										</computed-column>
										<computed-column name="enabled"
											type="tl.core:Boolean"
											width="90"
										>
											<label>
												<en>Enabled</en>
												<de>Aktiv</de>
											</label>
											<value>r -> $r['enabled']</value>
										</computed-column>
										<computed-column name="ruleState"
											type="tl.core:String"
											width="110"
										>
											<label>
												<en>State</en>
												<de>Zustand</de>
											</label>
											<value>r -> $r['state']</value>
										</computed-column>
										<computed-column name="firings"
											type="tl.core:Integer"
											width="90"
										>
											<label>
												<en>Firings</en>
												<de>Auslösungen</de>
											</label>
											<value>r -> $r['firings']</value>
										</computed-column>
										<computed-column name="trigger"
											type="tl.core:String"
											width="280"
										>
											<label>
												<en>Last trigger</en>
												<de>Letzter Auslöser</de>
											</label>
											<value>r -> $r['trigger']</value>
										</computed-column>
										<computed-column name="action"
											type="tl.core:String"
											width="300"
										>
											<label>
												<en>Last action</en>
												<de>Letzte Aktion</de>
											</label>
											<value>r -> $r['action']</value>
										</computed-column>
										<computed-column name="timers"
											type="tl.core:String"
											width="160"
										>
											<label>
												<en>Timers</en>
												<de>Timer</de>
											</label>
											<value>r -> $r['timers']</value>
										</computed-column>
										<computed-column name="parameters"
											type="tl.core:String"
											width="220"
										>
											<label>
												<en>Parameters</en>
												<de>Parameter</de>
											</label>
											<value>r -> $r['parameters']</value>
										</computed-column>
										<computed-column name="errors"
											type="tl.core:Integer"
											width="80"
										>
											<label>
												<en>Errors</en>
												<de>Fehler</de>
											</label>
											<value>r -> $r['errors']</value>
										</computed-column>
										<computed-column name="error"
											type="tl.core:String"
											width="300"
										>
											<label>
												<en>Last error</en>
												<de>Letzter Fehler</de>
											</label>
											<value>r -> $r['error']</value>
										</computed-column>
									</columns>
									<rows>s -> $s['rules']</rows>
								</table>
							</tab>
							<tab id="parameters"
								icon="css:bi bi-sliders"
							>
								<label>
									<en>Parameters</en>
									<de>Parameter</de>
								</label>
								<split-panel
									orientation="horizontal"
									resizable="true"
								>
									<panes>
										<pane
											min-size="300"
											size="65"
											unit="%"
										>
											<table
												filter-bar="true"
												selection="selectedParameter"
											>
												<inputs>
													<input channel="state"/>
												</inputs>
												<columns>
													<computed-column name="rule"
														type="tl.core:String"
														width="160"
													>
														<label>
															<en>Rule</en>
															<de>Regel</de>
														</label>
														<value>r -> $r['rule']</value>
													</computed-column>
													<computed-column name="parameter"
														type="tl.core:String"
														width="140"
													>
														<label>
															<en>Parameter</en>
															<de>Parameter</de>
														</label>
														<value>r -> $r['parameter']</value>
													</computed-column>
													<computed-column name="type"
														type="tl.core:String"
														width="100"
													>
														<label>
															<en>Type</en>
															<de>Typ</de>
														</label>
														<value>r -> $r['type']</value>
													</computed-column>
													<computed-column name="value"
														type="tl.core:String"
														width="120"
													>
														<label>
															<en>Value</en>
															<de>Wert</de>
														</label>
														<value>r -> $r['value']</value>
													</computed-column>
													<computed-column name="default"
														type="tl.core:String"
														width="120"
													>
														<label>
															<en>Default</en>
															<de>Vorgabe</de>
														</label>
														<value>r -> $r['default']</value>
													</computed-column>
													<computed-column name="overridden"
														type="tl.core:Boolean"
														width="110"
													>
														<label>
															<en>Override</en>
															<de>Überschrieben</de>
														</label>
														<value>r -> $r['overridden']</value>
													</computed-column>
													<computed-column name="adjustable"
														type="tl.core:Boolean"
														width="110"
													>
														<label>
															<en>Adjustable</en>
															<de>Einstellbar</de>
														</label>
														<value>r -> $r['adjustable']</value>
													</computed-column>
												</columns>
												<rows>s -> $s['parameters']</rows>
											</table>
										</pane>
										<pane
											min-size="240"
											size="35"
											unit="%"
										>
											<panel>
												<title>
													<en>Set the parameter</en>
													<de>Parameter setzen</de>
												</title>
												<inset>
													<stack gap="default">
														<fields max-columns="1">
															<value-input
																type="tl.core:String"
																value="parameterValue"
															>
																<label>
																	<en>Value (a literal: true, 21.5, 3min, 06:30)</en>
																	<de>Wert (ein Literal: true, 21.5, 3min, 06:30)</de>
																</label>
															</value-input>
														</fields>
														<stack
															direction="row"
															gap="compact"
														>
															<button>
																<action class="com.top_logic.layout.view.command.GenericViewCommand"
																	image="css:bi bi-check2"
																	input="state"
																>
																	<label>
																		<en>Set</en>
																		<de>Setzen</de>
																	</label>
																	<executability>
																		<model-access
																			object="project"
																			operation="Write"
																		/>
																		<disabled-if expr="s -> simulationRunVeto($s['project'], $s)"/>
																	</executability>
																	<execute-script function="r -> v -> s -> simulationSetParameter($s['project'], $r, $v)">
																		<inputs>
																			<input channel="selectedParameter"/>
																			<input channel="parameterValue"/>
																		</inputs>
																	</execute-script>
																	<write-channel name="refresh"/>
																</action>
															</button>
															<button>
																<action class="com.top_logic.layout.view.command.GenericViewCommand"
																	image="css:bi bi-arrow-counterclockwise"
																	input="state"
																>
																	<label>
																		<en>Reset to the default</en>
																		<de>Auf die Vorgabe zurücksetzen</de>
																	</label>
																	<executability>
																		<model-access
																			object="project"
																			operation="Write"
																		/>
																		<disabled-if expr="s -> simulationRunVeto($s['project'], $s)"/>
																	</executability>
																	<execute-script function="r -> s -> simulationResetParameter($s['project'], $r)">
																		<inputs>
																			<input channel="selectedParameter"/>
																		</inputs>
																	</execute-script>
																	<write-channel name="refresh"/>
																</action>
															</button>
														</stack>
													</stack>
												</inset>
											</panel>
										</pane>
									</panes>
								</split-panel>
							</tab>
							<tab id="datapoints"
								icon="css:bi bi-list-ul"
							>
								<label>
									<en>Datapoints</en>
									<de>Datenpunkte</de>
								</label>
								<split-panel
									orientation="horizontal"
									resizable="true"
								>
									<panes>
										<pane
											min-size="300"
											size="65"
											unit="%"
										>
											<table
												filter-bar="true"
												selection="selectedDatapoint"
											>
												<inputs>
													<input channel="state"/>
												</inputs>
												<columns>
													<computed-column name="id"
														type="tl.core:String"
														width="160"
													>
														<label>
															<en>Datapoint</en>
															<de>Datenpunkt</de>
														</label>
														<value>r -> $r['id']</value>
													</computed-column>
													<computed-column name="type"
														type="tl.core:String"
														width="100"
													>
														<label>
															<en>Type</en>
															<de>Typ</de>
														</label>
														<value>r -> $r['type']</value>
													</computed-column>
													<computed-column name="value"
														type="tl.core:String"
														width="140"
													>
														<label>
															<en>Value</en>
															<de>Wert</de>
														</label>
														<value>r -> $r['value']</value>
													</computed-column>
													<computed-column name="quality"
														type="tl.core:String"
														width="100"
													>
														<label>
															<en>Quality</en>
															<de>Qualität</de>
														</label>
														<value>r -> $r['quality']</value>
													</computed-column>
													<computed-column name="updated"
														type="tl.core:String"
														width="220"
													>
														<label>
															<en>Last update</en>
															<de>Letzte Änderung</de>
														</label>
														<value>r -> $r['updated']</value>
													</computed-column>
													<computed-column name="binding"
														type="tl.core:String"
														width="220"
													>
														<label>
															<en>Binding</en>
															<de>Anbindung</de>
														</label>
														<value>r -> $r['binding']</value>
													</computed-column>
												</columns>
												<rows>s -> $s['datapoints']</rows>
											</table>
										</pane>
										<pane
											min-size="240"
											size="35"
											unit="%"
										>
											<panel>
												<title>
													<en>Value of the datapoint</en>
													<de>Wert des Datenpunkts</de>
												</title>
												<inset>
													<stack gap="default">
														<fields max-columns="1">
															<value-input
																type="tl.core:String"
																value="datapointValue"
															>
																<label>
																	<en>Value (a literal: true, 21.5, 06:30)</en>
																	<de>Wert (ein Literal: true, 21.5, 06:30)</de>
																</label>
															</value-input>
														</fields>
														<stack
															direction="row"
															gap="compact"
															wrap="true"
														>
															<button>
																<action class="com.top_logic.layout.view.command.GenericViewCommand"
																	image="css:bi bi-send"
																	input="state"
																>
																	<label>
																		<en>Send from the installation</en>
																		<de>Aus der Installation senden</de>
																	</label>
																	<executability>
																		<model-access
																			object="project"
																			operation="Write"
																		/>
																		<disabled-if expr="s -> simulationRunVeto($s['project'], $s)"/>
																	</executability>
																	<execute-script function="d -> v -> s -> simulationSend($s['project'], $d, $v)">
																		<inputs>
																			<input channel="selectedDatapoint"/>
																			<input channel="datapointValue"/>
																		</inputs>
																	</execute-script>
																	<write-channel name="refresh"/>
																</action>
															</button>
															<button>
																<action class="com.top_logic.layout.view.command.GenericViewCommand"
																	image="css:bi bi-pencil"
																	input="state"
																>
																	<label>
																		<en>Command</en>
																		<de>Befehlen</de>
																	</label>
																	<executability>
																		<model-access
																			object="project"
																			operation="Write"
																		/>
																		<disabled-if expr="s -> simulationRunVeto($s['project'], $s)"/>
																	</executability>
																	<execute-script function="d -> v -> s -> simulationCommand($s['project'], $d, $v)">
																		<inputs>
																			<input channel="selectedDatapoint"/>
																			<input channel="datapointValue"/>
																		</inputs>
																	</execute-script>
																	<write-channel name="refresh"/>
																</action>
															</button>
														</stack>
														<text
															tone="helper"
															variant="caption"
														>
															<label>
																<en>"Send from the installation": the device whose object sends to the address of the datapoint sends the value as a group telegram, as a push button or sensor would. "Command": the value is commanded as the UI of a controller does; a datapoint that transmits sends it to the bus.</en>
																<de>„Aus der Installation senden“: Das Gerät, dessen Objekt an die Adresse des Datenpunkts sendet, sendet den Wert als Gruppentelegramm, wie es ein Taster oder Sensor täte. „Befehlen“: Der Wert wird befohlen, wie es die Oberfläche eines Controllers tut; ein Datenpunkt, der überträgt, sendet ihn auf den Bus.</de>
															</label>
														</text>
													</stack>
												</inset>
											</panel>
										</pane>
									</panes>
								</split-panel>
							</tab>
							<tab id="timeline"
								icon="css:bi bi-clock-history"
							>
								<label>
									<en>Timeline</en>
									<de>Zeitleiste</de>
								</label>
								<table filter-bar="true">
									<inputs>
										<input channel="state"/>
									</inputs>
									<columns>
										<computed-column name="time"
											type="tl.core:String"
											width="210"
										>
											<label>
												<en>Simulated time</en>
												<de>Simulierte Zeit</de>
											</label>
											<value>r -> $r['time']</value>
										</computed-column>
										<computed-column name="kind"
											type="tl.core:String"
											width="100"
										>
											<label>
												<en>Kind</en>
												<de>Art</de>
											</label>
											<value>r -> $r['kind']</value>
										</computed-column>
										<computed-column name="source"
											type="tl.core:String"
											width="160"
										>
											<label>
												<en>Source</en>
												<de>Quelle</de>
											</label>
											<value>r -> $r['source']</value>
										</computed-column>
										<computed-column name="text"
											type="tl.core:String"
											width="600"
										>
											<label>
												<en>What happened</en>
												<de>Was geschah</de>
											</label>
											<value>r -> $r['text']</value>
										</computed-column>
									</columns>
									<rows>s -> $s['timeline']</rows>
								</table>
							</tab>
							<tab id="devices"
								icon="css:bi bi-arrow-left-right"
							>
								<label>
									<en>Device behaviour</en>
									<de>Geräteverhalten</de>
								</label>
								<split-panel
									orientation="horizontal"
									resizable="true"
								>
									<panes>
										<pane
											min-size="300"
											size="60"
											unit="%"
										>
											<panel>
												<title>
													<en>Object followers</en>
													<de>Objektfolgen</de>
												</title>
												<commands>
													<generic-command
														image="css:bi bi-plus-lg"
														input="project"
														placement="TOOLBAR"
													>
														<label>
															<en>New object follower</en>
															<de>Neue Objektfolge</de>
														</label>
														<executability>
															<model-access operation="Write"/>
															<null-input-disabled/>
														</executability>
														<with-transaction>
															<execute-script function="p -> { f = new(`ehome.runtime:ObjectFollower`); $p.add(`ehome.project:Project#simulationFollowers`, $f); $f; }"/>
														</with-transaction>
														<write-channel name="follower"/>
													</generic-command>
													<generic-command
														image="css:bi bi-trash"
														input="follower"
														placement="TOOLBAR"
													>
														<label>
															<en>Delete the object follower</en>
															<de>Objektfolge löschen</de>
														</label>
														<executability>
															<null-input-disabled/>
														</executability>
														<delete-object/>
														<write-channel name="follower"/>
													</generic-command>
												</commands>
												<stack gap="compact">
													<inset>
														<text
															tone="helper"
															variant="caption"
														>
															<label>
																<en>The program data of a device does not say what its application does between its objects. Name here which object follows which: the state object takes every value the switching object receives from the bus and sends it like its own, inverted if checked (for an object of one bit). The pairs take effect when a simulation starts.</en>
																<de>Die Programmdaten eines Geräts sagen nicht, was seine Applikation zwischen seinen Objekten tut. Hier wird festgelegt, welches Objekt welchem folgt: Das Statusobjekt übernimmt jeden Wert, den das Schaltobjekt vom Bus empfängt, und sendet ihn wie seinen eigenen, invertiert, wenn angekreuzt (für ein Objekt von einem Bit). Die Paare gelten ab dem nächsten Start einer Simulation.</de>
															</label>
														</text>
													</inset>
													<table
														observed-types="ehome.runtime:ObjectFollower"
														selection="follower"
														types="ehome.runtime:ObjectFollower"
													>
														<inputs>
															<input channel="project"/>
														</inputs>
														<columns>
															<column attribute="device"/>
															<column attribute="source"/>
															<column attribute="follower"/>
															<column attribute="inverted"/>
														</columns>
														<rows>p -> if($p == null, [], $p.get(`ehome.project:Project#simulationFollowers`))</rows>
													</table>
												</stack>
											</panel>
										</pane>
										<pane
											min-size="240"
											size="40"
											unit="%"
										>
											<panel>
												<title>
													<en>Object follower</en>
													<de>Objektfolge</de>
												</title>
												<form
													input="follower"
													with-inset="true"
												>
													<field attribute="device"/>
													<field attribute="source">
													<input-control class="de.haumacher.ehome.view.OptionOrderSelectControlProvider"/>
												</field>
													<field attribute="follower">
													<input-control class="de.haumacher.ehome.view.OptionOrderSelectControlProvider"/>
												</field>
													<field attribute="inverted"/>
												</form>
											</panel>
										</pane>
									</panes>
								</split-panel>
							</tab>
						</tabs>
					</tab-bar>
				</pane>
			</panes>
		</split-panel>
	</simulation-updates>
</view>
